              <td>Hoppscotch</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>want the most Postman-like desktop app, with Git <em>or</em> cloud, and more protocols</td>
              <td>Insomnia</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>mostly work in the terminal</td>
              <td>HTTPie (or curl)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>want to stay in VS Code</td>
              <td>Thunder Client or REST Client</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>want a polished local-first app and will pay for work use</td>
              <td>Yaak</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>want one platform for design, testing, mocks and docs</td>
              <td>Apidog, or stay on Postman</td>
